<event name="SC_TERRAN_PATROL_EVADE_SUCCESS">
	<text>
		You divert power to evasive maneuvers and break away before the patrol can establish a firing solution.
	</text>
</event>
<event name="SC_TERRAN_PATROL_EVADE_FAILURE">
	<text>
		You push the engines hard, but the patrol anticipates your course and cuts off your escape.
	</text>
	<ship hostile="true"/>
</event>
<eventList name="SC_TERRAN_PATROL_CLOAK_ROLL">
	<event load="SC_TERRAN_PATROL_CLOAK_SUCCESS"/>
	<event load="SC_TERRAN_PATROL_CLOAK_SUCCESS"/>
	<event load="SC_TERRAN_PATROL_CLOAK_FAILURE"/>
</eventList>
<event name="SC_TERRAN_PATROL_CLOAK_SUCCESS">
	<text>
		You cloak and drift beyond the patrol's search pattern. By the time your signature returns, the Terran ship is scanning the wrong part of the beacon.
	</text>
</event>
<event name="SC_TERRAN_PATROL_CLOAK_FAILURE">
	<text>
		You cloak, but the patrol has already narrowed your position. They spread their search pattern and catch you as your cloak begins to fade.
	</text>
	<ship hostile="true"/>
</event>
<event name="SC_TERRAN_PATROL_FIGHT">
	<text>
		The patrol closes in before you can escape. You power your weapons and prepare for battle.
	</text>
	<ship hostile="true"/>
</event>

