<event name="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT">
	<text>
		A Terran scout drops out of FTL almost on top of you. It catches your transponder signature before you can mask it and immediately turns to flee.
	</text>

	<choice req="WEAPON_PREIGNITE" lvl="1" hidden="true" blue="false" max_group="0">
		<text>Continue...</text>
		<event load="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_PREIGNITER"/>
	</choice>

	<choice req="WEAPON_PREIGNITE" lvl="0" max_lvl="0" hidden="true" blue="false" max_group="0">
		<text>Continue...</text>
		<event load="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_STANDARD"/>
	</choice>
</event>

<event name="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_STANDARD">
	<text>
		You will have to act quickly if you want to stop the scout from escaping. If it gets away, it will warn the pursuing fleet.
	</text>

	<choice req="FTL_JAMMER" hidden="true" blue="true" max_group="1">
		<text>(FTL Jammer) Jam the scout's drive before it can escape.</text>
