<event name="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_WEAPON_SUCCESS">
	<text>
		Your opening volley catches the scout before it can widen the gap. The shots rake across its engine housing.
	</text>
	<ship load="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_SHIP" hostile="true"/>
	<status type="loss" target="enemy" system="engines" amount="2"/>
	<triggeredEvent event="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_ENGINE_STATUS_CLEAR" time="45" thisFight="true">
		<triggeredEventBox load="DEFAULT_SMALL">
			<tooltip>The scout's damaged engines will recover in this amount of time.</tooltip>
		</triggeredEventBox>
		<timerSounds load="DEFAULT_TIMER_SOUNDS"/>
	</triggeredEvent>
</event>

<event name="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_WEAPON_FAILURE">
	<text>
		You fire as the scout veers away, but the shot goes wide.
	</text>
	<ship load="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_SHIP" hostile="true"/>
</event>

<event name="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_HACKING_SUCCESS">
	<text>
		Your hacking system breaks into the scout's drive control. Its engines lock into a diagnostic loop, buying you time to finish the fight.
	</text>
	<ship load="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_SHIP" hostile="true"/>
	<status type="limit" target="enemy" system="engines" amount="0"/>
	<triggeredEvent event="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_ENGINE_STATUS_CLEAR" time="45" thisFight="true">
		<triggeredEventBox load="DEFAULT_SMALL">
			<tooltip>The scout's engine lockdown will expire in this amount of time.</tooltip>
		</triggeredEventBox>
		<timerSounds load="DEFAULT_TIMER_SOUNDS"/>
	</triggeredEvent>
</event>

<event name="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_HACKING_FAILURE">
	<text>
		You try to break into the scout's engine controls, but its emergency protocols reject the intrusion.
	</text>
	<ship load="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_SHIP" hostile="true"/>
</event>

<event name="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_FTL_JAMMER">
	<text>
		Your FTL Jammer floods the scout's drive with interference. Its escape vector collapses before the ship can jump.
	</text>
	<ship load="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_SHIP" hostile="true"/>
	<status type="limit" target="enemy" system="engines" amount="0"/>
	<triggeredEvent event="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_ENGINE_STATUS_CLEAR" time="45" thisFight="true">
		<triggeredEventBox load="DEFAULT_SMALL">
			<tooltip>The scout's jammed engines will recover in this amount of time.</tooltip>
		</triggeredEventBox>
		<timerSounds load="DEFAULT_TIMER_SOUNDS"/>
	</triggeredEvent>
</event>

<event name="SC_TERRAN_SCOUT_FIGHT">
	<text>
